  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759366,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Music Construction Set for Commodore 64 - Description\n\nCompose your own music with ease on the Commodore 64 with *Music Construction Set*! This innovative program, originally designed for the Apple II, brings a groundbreaking graphical user interface to music creation. Simply drag and drop notes, sharps, and other musical symbols directly onto the staff to build your compositions. Play back your creations through the Commodore 64’s multi-channel audio hardware, and print your finished masterpieces.\n\nWhether you’re an experienced songwriter or a budding novice, *Music Construction Set* provides a powerful and enjoyable way to explore musical creation. The program includes sample songs to get you started, and while a joystick is required for note-by-note input, the intuitive design makes it accessible to all skill levels. Discover the joy of composing your own tunes and bringing them to life on your Commodore 64! It's a powerful music processor and a joy to use."
    },
